nal_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":344,"prompt_tokens":11221,"total_tokens":11565,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":59,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":344},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11221}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-7794a965-0bb3-944e-b601-4bfb3d798f49","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e18-e0a1-76f3-8ea3-aa29c2e22bd2-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"capture_seconds":5,"labels":"person","operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4"},"id":"call_e2f9e67c47164c44919186f2","type":"tool_call"},{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ffprobe -v quiet -print_format json -show_streams -show_format /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4 | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); streams=d.get('streams',[]); print(f'Duration: {d.get(\\\"format\\\",{}).get(\\\"duration\\\",\\\"N/A\\\")}s'); [print(f'{s.get(\\\"codec_type\\\")}: {s.get(\\\"width\\\",\\\"?\\\")}x{s.get(\\\"height\\\",\\\"?\\\")}, fps={s.get(\\\"r_frame_rate\\\",\\\"?\\\")}, codec={s.get(\\\"codec_name\\\",\\\"?\\\")}') for s in streams]\"","description":"检查视频的分辨率、时长等元数据"},"id":"call_e52e616b44844b928c1ceaad","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11221,"output_tokens":344,"total_tokens":11565,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":59}}},{"content":"{\"skill\": \"video-object-analytics\", \"status\": \"success\", \"operation\": \"detect\", \"executed_skills\": [\"video-object-analytics\", \"frame-sampling\", \"object-detection\"], \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\", \"artifacts\": {\"frames_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/710b582c2aae/frames.json\", \"detections_json\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-object-analytics/710b582c2aae/detections.json\"}, \"summary\": {\"frame_count\": 6, \"per_frame\": [{\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000000800_0001\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000010800_0002\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000020800_0003\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000030800_0004\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:03+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000040800_0005\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:04+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}, {\"frame_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_202605201000050800_0006\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:05+08:00\", \"counts\": {}, \"object_count\": 0}], \"frame_detection_totals\": {}, \"total_frame_detections\": 0, \"unique_object_count\": null, \"unique_object_count_note\": \"Detection frames are not deduplicated; use operation=track for cross-frame identities.\", \"model\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/models/yolov8n.pt\"}}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"video_object_analytics","id":"2d30165c-68c0-4940-8d85-3fc0f5ebc674","tool_call_id":"call_e2f9e67c47164c44919186f2","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"Duration: 30.000000s\nvideo: 1280x674, fps=12/1, codec=h264","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"c182aa5b-2b29-420d-bbfa-c2cab8b29967","tool_call_id":"call_e52e616b44844b928c1ceaad","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"根据对这段视频的实际分析，以下是逐项能力评估：\n\n---\n\n## 视频基本信息\n\n| 项目 | 数据 |\n|------|------|\n| 时长 | 30 秒 |\n| 分辨率 | 1280×674（非高清） |\n| 帧率 | 12 fps（偏低） |\n| 编码 | H.264 |\n\n---\n\n## 四项需求逐一说明\n\n### 1. 确认具体人员身份 — ❌ 无法支持\n\n- **检测事实**：在视频前 5 秒的 6 个采样帧中，YOLOv8n 目标检测模型返回了 **零个行人（person）** 检测结果。即使后续帧有行人出现，该模型也无法识别人脸特征。\n- **根本限制**：即便画面中有清晰人脸，身份确认需要人脸识别模型 + 已知人员数据库比对，当前环境不具备此类能力。\n- **结论**：无法确认任何人的具体身份。\n\n### 2. 读取模糊车牌 — ❌ 无法支持\n\n- **检测事实**：车辆检测在前 3 秒识别到约 11 辆车（小汽车 9 辆 + 公交车 2 辆），但这是\"框出位置\"级别的检测，不涉及车牌区域提取。\n- **根本限制**：读取车牌需要专门的牌照识别（LPR/ANPR）模型，且要求车牌区域在画面中达到可辨识的清晰度。当前视频分辨率较低、帧率偏低，且您已明确车牌是\"模糊\"的，OCR 或专用识别模型均无法可靠还原。\n- **结论**：无法读取任何车牌号码。\n\n### 3. 生成全市热力图 — ❌ 无法支持\n\n- **数据量不足**：单一路段摄像头只能覆盖一个极小的地理范围，不足以代表\"全市\"交通密度。\n- **根本限制**：热力图需要多路摄像头数据源（至少数十个以上分布在全市的点位）或完整的路网流量数据，通过空间聚合才能生成有意义的城市级热力图。\n- **结论**：仅凭一段本地视频无法生成全市热力图。\n\n### 4. 接入实时 RTSP — ❌ 超出当前任务范围\n\n- **性质不同**：这不是数据分析能力，而是**系统基础设施配置**工作。\n- **需要的条件**：\n  - 实际部署的 RTSP 摄像头设备及其 URL\n  - 网络连通性（RTSP 通常需要内网可达）\n  - 流媒体服务中间件（如 GStreamer、FFmpeg server、SRS 等）\n  - 与平台后端的集成开发\n- **结论**：这需要额外的硬件和工程部署，不在视频分析的范畴内。\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n| 需求 | 可行性 | 原因 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 人员身份确认 | ❌ | 未检测到行人；无人脸识别+数据库能力 |\n| 模糊车牌读取 | ❌ | 无 LPR/OCR 模型；视频分辨率低 |\n| 全市热力图 | ❌ | 单点数据无法代表全市；缺多路数据源 |\n| 接入实时 RTSP | ❌ | 属基础设施工程，非数据分析能力 |\n\n**当前唯一可行的分析**：利用现有视频做基础的车辆检测和追踪（已执行，检测到约 26 辆车次、3-5 辆公交车出现在前几秒画面中）。如需进一步分析（如车流量统计、车型分类、轨迹追踪），可以在该基础上继续扩展。","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":1125,"prompt_tokens":12230,"total_tokens":13355,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":353,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":1125},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":12230}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-80b4eb63-e92d-9857-8711-c941300ae560","finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e19-0383-7151-ba5f-bf9821ef53d1-0","tool_calls":[],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":12230,"output_tokens":1125,"total_tokens":13355,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":353}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"capability_inventory","original_query":"我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","normalized_query":"我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 rtsp，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","routing_query":"列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力。用户原始问题：我想确认视频里具体人员的身份、读取模糊车牌、生成全市热力图并接入实时 RTSP，但当前只有这段本地视频。请说明哪些能力无法由现有数据支持，不要编造结果。","scene":null,"scene_name":null,"params":{},"scene_mode":null,"scenes":[],"task_spans":[],"planning_steps":[],"scene_tasks":[],"sub_tasks":[],"task_hints":[],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.85,"reason":"capability_inventory","_source_message_key":"id:21c9771b-d3a5-4236-861c-7856429c4a79"},"routing_context":{"trigger":false,"route_reason":"No intent scene for scene skill filter","_source_message_key":"id:21c9771b-d3a5-4236-861c-7856429c4a79"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":[]}

